            "notes": "Attack speed is the same as buying weapon power. But it's easier and cheaper to buy attack speed rather than weapon power items. Items like [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) give INSANE dps for you since hitting a shield or armor is instantly 15% attack speed. [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8) is also a strong item for more self sustain and extra life steal.\n\nGet [Smart-Armor](item_2e0f4a99-c818-49c1-ace2-ba8d6f282da8) if you really need.\n\nHold onto [Winton](item_1c8c3f53-4ed4-417f-a3b2-e7c52bda907a) if you bought him last round.",
