            "notes": "Sell [Winton](item_1c8c3f53-4ed4-417f-a3b2-e7c52bda907a) if you still have him.\n\n[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) and [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) are the core items to this build. Giving you life steal and 20% more DPS.\n\nHaving [Electro Cluster](item_2ce040d2-6b47-4be6-83b3-f8266c2c2b48) is a massive power spike and sets you up for the rest of the game. The more enemies you cleave, the more damage you do and the more you heal.",
