            "created_at": "2025-09-09T12:46:23.753506+00:00",
            "notes": "Lots of good item choices for this round so pick what you think works best for you :)\n\n[Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) is amazing against big burst damage heroes like Cassidy, Rein, Reaper and JQ. That 15% dot gets healed back as you're doing damage.\n\n[Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) is a great item for just an insane amount of damage.\n\n[Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) is good at taking attack speed from other weapon power focused builds. boosts your DPS a ton and since you cleave you'll get a big burst of attack speed since it's \"per target\"\n\n[Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4) for staying in the fight longer.",
